{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>Who is not betrothed.</b> For the betrothed woman, even though she has not had relations, is called another man's wife." "<b>He shall surely pay a bride-price.</b> Like מוהר in the sense of tied, like אַחַר מָהֲרוּ (Psalms 16:4), for the pattern מהרה is not found in verbs except in the dagesh binyan in all of Scripture."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:37:22.779631995Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}